<title>LATVIA: MULTIBANKA FIVE MONTH PROFIT FALLS.</title>
<headline>MULTIBANKA FIVE MONTH PROFIT FALLS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Multibanka, Latvia's 17th largest bank, on Thursday said its five month profit fell to 211,000 lats versus 229,000 lats at the end of April.</p>
<p>The bank's assets came to 18.78 million lats in May against 16.95 million the month before, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>Deposits with Multibanka have grown to 12.42 million lats at the end of May against 11.15 million lats in April and it has granted credits worth 2.39 million lats in May versus last monbth's 2.04 million lats.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
